<title>POLAND: PROCHNIK NAMES ACTING CEO FULL PRESIDENT.</title>
<headline>PROCHNIK NAMES ACTING CEO FULL PRESIDENT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The supervisory board of Polish garment maker Prochnik SA has appointed acting President Adam Sasiadek president, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Sasiadek, previously deputy president for financial planning, had been acting president since September 14.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
